.TH graph 1  "graph " 
.SH NAME
graph \- Export the raw architecture graph (nodes + edges), bypassing policy findings entirely
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgraph\fR [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export the raw architecture graph (nodes + edges), bypassing policy findings entirely
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR [default: dot]
dot or json. Independent of `\-\-format`, which only applies to finding reports
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: .]

